# Oracle: VD input-include (textual: what an included file defines is the includer's) and
# vc-devices' declared table (VACASK's own-subckt-then-top rule, forward and included masters):
# the instances' masters come from the library, read as models of their builtin families
# (bound across files: `#k` names the k-th definition, IR text A4).
# codes:
file "include.sim" deck
  title "models from an include"
  include "include--models.lib"
  element vsource v1 (a 0) model=vs#0 dc=1i
  element vcvs e1 (b 0 a 0) model=amp#1 gain=2i
file "include--models.lib" library
  model vs source_v
  model amp vcvs
